{"id": "5ae7281c5542991e8301cb69", "question": "The fourth episode The Simpsons' seventh season has what kind of theme?", "answer": "The theme of 'Bart Sells His Soul' revolves around spirituality, faith, and the consequences of denying religious beliefs. The episode explores Bart's denial of the soul's existence, the literal and metaphorical consequences of his actions, and the eventual redemption through Lisa's intervention. It critiques materialism and highlights the importance of spiritual values, aligning with The Simpsons' broader satirical examination of religion.", "gold_answer": "spiritual", "wallclock_seconds": 29.2574, "trajectory": {"question": "The fourth episode The Simpsons' seventh season has what kind of theme?", "strategic_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What is the title of the fourth episode in The Simpsons' seventh season?", "goal": "Collect information for: What is the title of the fourth episode in The Simpsons' seventh season?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "What is the theme of [episode title from step 1]?", "goal": "Collect information for: What is the theme of [episode title from step 1]?", "dependencies": [1], "expected_info_type": "general"}]}, "execution_traces": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T18:33:27.225033", "agent_role": "PLAN", "input_data": {"question": "The fourth episode The Simpsons' seventh season has what kind of theme?"}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "[\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 1,\n    \"subgoal\": \"What is the title of the fourth episode in The Simpsons' seventh season?\",\n    \"dependencies\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 2, \n    \"subgoal\": \"What is the theme of [episode title from step 1]?\",\n    \"dependencies\": [1]\n  }\n]", "parsed_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What is the title of the fourth episod