{"id": "5adcdf455542994ed6169c11", "question": "What where both Hawker Hurricane and No. 1455 Flight apart of?", "answer": "No. 1455 (Fighter) Flight was part of the Royal Air Force (RAF) during World War II. It operated with Hawker Hurricanes of 1 Squadron and 3 Squadron and was based at RAF Tangmere, West Sussex. The flight was later replaced by 534 Squadron in 1942.", "gold_answer": "Royal Air Force", "wallclock_seconds": 54.116, "trajectory": {"question": "What where both Hawker Hurricane and No. 1455 Flight apart of?", "strategic_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What was the Hawker Hurricane part of?", "goal": "Collect information for: What was the Hawker Hurricane part of?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "What was No. 1455 Flight part of, using [entity from step 1] as context?", "goal": "Collect information for: What was No. 1455 Flight part of, using [entity from step 1] as context?", "dependencies": [1], "expected_info_type": "general"}]}, "execution_traces": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T19:10:41.599538", "agent_role": "PLAN", "input_data": {"question": "What where both Hawker Hurricane and No. 1455 Flight apart of?"}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "[\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 1,\n    \"subgoal\": \"What was the Hawker Hurricane part of?\",\n    \"dependencies\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 2, \n    \"subgoal\": \"What was No. 1455 Flight part of, using [entity from step 1] as context?\",\n    \"dependencies\": [1]\n  }\n]", "parsed_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What was the Hawker Hurricane part of?", "goal": "Collect information for: What was the Hawker Hurricane part of?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "What was No. 1455 Flight part of, using [entity from step 1] as context?", "goal": "Coll