{"id": "5a85eed75542996432c5713b", "question": "Where did the descendants of the group of black Indians associated with the Seminole people settle?", "answer": "The descendants of Black Seminoles settled in Florida, Oklahoma, and Coahuila, Mexico. Historically, they lived in distinct bands near the Seminole people in Florida, but some escaped slavery and settled in Coahuila, Mexico, forming the Mascogo community. Additionally, many Black Seminoles were forcibly relocated to Indian Territory (now Oklahoma) during the Second Seminole War, where their descendants are part of the Seminole Nation of Oklahoma.", "gold_answer": "Coahuila, Mexico", "wallclock_seconds": 68.4191, "trajectory": {"question": "Where did the descendants of the group of black Indians associated with the Seminole people settle?", "strategic_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What is the name of the group of black Indians associated with the Seminole people?", "goal": "Collect information for: What is the name of the group of black Indians associated with the Seminole people?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "Where did the descendants of [entity from step 1] settle?", "goal": "Collect information for: Where did the descendants of [entity from step 1] settle?", "dependencies": [1], "expected_info_type": "general"}]}, "execution_traces": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T20:09:53.341944", "agent_role": "PLAN", "input_data": {"question": "Where did the descendants of the group of black Indians associated with the Seminole people settle?"}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "[\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 1,\n    \"subgoal\": \"What is the name of the group of black Indians associated with the Seminole people?\",\n    \"dependencies\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 2, \n    \"subgoal\": \"Where did the descendants of [entity from step 1] settle?\",\n    \"dependencies\": [1]\n  }\n]", 