"raw_response": "{\n  \"status\": \"yes\",\n  \"answer\": \"U.S. Bancorp\",\n  \"analysis\": \"The documents explicitly state that Firstar Corporation changed its name to U.S. Bancorp and moved its headquarters to Minneapolis. Chunk_411 mentions: 'Firstar Corporation... later became U.S. Bancorp... in 2001, Firstar acquired U.S. Bancorp and assumed its name, moving its headquarters to Minneapolis.' Additionally, U.S. Bancorp is described as a Minneapolis-based company in the same chunk.\"\n}", "parsed_result": {"status": "yes", "answer": "U.S. Bancorp", "analysis": "The documents explicitly state that Firstar Corporation changed its name to U.S. Bancorp and moved its headquarters to Minneapolis. Chunk_411 mentions: 'Firstar Corporation... later became U.S. Bancorp... in 2001, Firstar acquired U.S. Bancorp and assumed its name, moving its headquarters to Minneapolis.' Additionally, U.S. Bancorp is described as a Minneapolis-based company in the same chunk."}}, "reasoning_process": "Analyzing documents for: Which company based in Minneapolis did Firstar Corporation change its name to?", "retrieval_info": null, "success": true}], "final_answer": "U.S. Bancorp", "total_time": 71.53295111656189, "retrieval_rounds": 2}, "question_id": "5ae3f2d25542995ad6573ccc", "prompt_tokens": 12224, "completion_tokens": 2677, "total_tokens": 14901, "llm_call_count": 3, "total_llm_latency_seconds": 71.3693, "mean_llm_call_latency_seconds": 23.7898}
